cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use XVPN in academic work, please cite it as below.
title: XVPN
abstract: >-
  A split-tunnel VPN client that takes a user-supplied WireGuard or OpenVPN
  profile and applies automatic traffic splitting between China and elsewhere,
  dual-resolver DNS with cross-validation, failure attribution derived from core
  logs, and evidence-based automatic routing correction. Built on sing-box for
  Windows and Android with a shared Flutter UI.
